><![CDATA[Florida man arrested for stealing $40,000 worth of trading cards from Target; faces upto 90 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130001987.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-man-arrested-for-stealing-40000-worth-of-trading-cards-from-target-using-cheap-taco-seasoning-packets/articleshow/130001987.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-man-arrested-for-stealing-40000-worth-of-trading-cards-from-target-using-cheap-taco-seasoning-packets/articleshow/130001987.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T21:04:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130001987,imgsize-82252.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Tipu’s ghost and Trump’s jibes haunt a transatlantic Franco-American rift]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130003821.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/tipus-ghost-and-trumps-jibes-haunt-a-transatlantic-franco-american-rift/articleshow/130003821.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/tipus-ghost-and-trumps-jibes-haunt-a-transatlantic-franco-american-rift/articleshow/130003821.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T20:42:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Chidanand Rajghatta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130004048,imgsize-975862.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US Budget 2027: Trump seeks record $1.5tn defence push amid Iran war]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130003463.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US President Donald Trump has proposed a massive $1.5 trillion defense budget for 2027. This plan significantly boosts military spending. It also calls for reducing non-defense outlays. The administration aims to shift some responsibilities to state and local governments. This proposal highlights a strong focus on national security amid ongoing conflicts. Congress will review these budget plans.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-budget-2027-trump-seeks-record-1-5tn-defence-push-amid-iran-war/articleshow/130003463.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-budget-2027-trump-seeks-record-1-5tn-defence-push-amid-iran-war/articleshow/130003463.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T20:17:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130003632,imgsize-983865.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Five Indians among 12 injured by Iranian missile debris in Abu Dhabi]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130001477.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Debris from an intercepted Iranian missile injured at least 12 people in Abu Dhabi. Five Indian nationals were among those hurt. The incident occurred in the Ajban area. This follows rising tensions in the Gulf region. Churches in the UAE announced closures for Easter Sunday. Iran's Revolutionary Guard warned of attacks on US tech companies.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/five-indians-among-12-injured-by-iranian-missile-debris-in-abu-dhabi/articleshow/130001477.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/five-indians-among-12-injured-by-iranian-missile-debris-in-abu-dhabi/articleshow/130001477.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T18:22:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130001577,imgsize-339159.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Amit Mehta? Indian-origin US judge at the centre of Trump immunity case linked to January 6 attack]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130001157.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-amit-mehta-indian-origin-us-judge-at-the-centre-of-trump-immunity-case-linked-to-january-6-attack/articleshow/130001157.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-amit-mehta-indian-origin-us-judge-at-the-centre-of-trump-immunity-case-linked-to-january-6-attack/articleshow/130001157.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T18:12:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130001157,imgsize-44158.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Boy claims he was a woman who died in a fire, details later match real case from decades ago]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129994758.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A young boy in Ohio claimed memories of a past life as a woman who died in a Chicago fire, later identifying details that appeared to match a real victim. The case, featured on television, drew attention for its specificity. While unexplained, it reflects a broader pattern of similar childhood accounts studied by researchers into reported past-life memories.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/boy-claims-he-was-a-woman-who-died-in-a-fire-details-later-match-real-case-from-decades-ago/articleshow/129994758.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/boy-claims-he-was-a-woman-who-died-in-a-fire-details-later-match-real-case-from-decades-ago/articleshow/129994758.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T17:32:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Trending Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130000313,imgsize-573719.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[France no longer hostile nation? After Macron snubs Trump, Iran allows ship to pass Hormuz]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130000016.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A French-owned container ship, the Kribi, crossed the Strait of Hormuz, potentially signaling a shift in Iran's view of France following President Macron's criticism of US policy. Macron rejected military intervention to reopen the strait, advocating for negotiations instead. The vessel's change of destination to "Owner France" may have signaled its nationality to Iranian authorities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/france-no-longer-hostile-nation-after-macron-snubs-trump-iran-allows-ship-to-pass-hormuz/articleshow/130000016.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/france-no-longer-hostile-nation-after-macron-snubs-trump-iran-allows-ship-to-pass-hormuz/articleshow/130000016.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T17:03:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130000041,imgsize-1122687.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Japan-led mission uncovers asteroid with all 5 ‘letters’ of DNA, breakthrough for understanding life’s origins]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129993675.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Analysis of samples from the asteroid Ryugu has revealed all five nucleobases essential to DNA and RNA, strengthening evidence that life’s chemical building blocks are widespread in space. While not proof of extraterrestrial life, the finding suggests asteroids could have delivered key ingredients to early Earth, offering new insight into how life’s fundamental chemistry may emerge across the universe.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/japan-led-mission-uncovers-asteroid-with-all-5-letters-of-dna-breakthrough-for-understanding-lifes-origins/articleshow/129993675.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/japan-led-mission-uncovers-asteroid-with-all-5-letters-of-dna-breakthrough-for-understanding-lifes-origins/articleshow/129993675.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T15:21:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129994334,imgsize-563335.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Oil, LNG supplies: Top Russian official Manturov signals fuel support for India during Middle East crisis]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129996442.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Russia's Deputy Chairman Denis Manturov highlighted a deepening energy partnership with India, stating Moscow can ramp up oil and LNG supplies amid the Middle East crisis. The visit also confirmed increased fertilizer supplies and ongoing collaboration in nuclear energy, alongside discussions on expanding industrial, space, and technological cooperation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/oil-lng-supplies-top-russian-official-manturov-signals-fuel-support-for-india-during-middle-east-crisis/articleshow/129996442.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/oil-lng-supplies-top-russian-official-manturov-signals-fuel-support-for-india-during-middle-east-crisis/articleshow/129996442.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T13:31:13+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Business Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129996928,imgsize-197638.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rishi Sunak praises Indian-origin Bodhana Sivanandan: 'England’s top female chess player']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129996516.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-news-englands-top-female-chess-player-rishi-sunak-hails-indian-origin-bodhana-sivanandan/articleshow/129996516.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-news-englands-top-female-chess-player-rishi-sunak-hails-indian-origin-bodhana-sivanandan/articleshow/129996516.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T13:01:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129996516,imgsize-89174.cms"/></item></channel></rss>